From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:49:13 -0500
Subject: feat: a page open in another window asks where to show it

A search in the command bar now also lists what is open in the profile's other
windows, and choosing one asks: Show Here moves the page into this window, in
the Space on screen, and Go to Window shows it where it is. Chromium's "Switch
to tab" for a page in another window asks the same, instead of a jump.

Why: the first part of S-94 (windows G12, commandbar K43). Ghost pins are the
rest.

Removable when: windows stop holding tabs of their own.
